      "text": "通过 queueForIdleConn 方法，尝试复用采用相\n同协议、访问相同服务端地址的空闲连接",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "通过 queueForIdleConn 方法，尝试复用采用相同协议、访问相同服务端地址的空闲连接",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YBHlwIvR2oharCyiajpVx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -431.9866730056376,
      "y": 4585.205250112472,
      "width": 791.171875,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
